{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you hate complicated controls?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip powerful weapons and wipe out your enemies with just a few clicks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instead, it requires luck and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009980/extras/98654b4a952f0a2e0e6c7ffa55b6d42b.avif?t=1759817764\" width=417 height=169 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Strengthen your weapons to become stronger!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spawn and enhance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >automatically attack the enemies that are rushing in.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don't forget to upgrade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009980/extras/0d36879237d517d8e7a158acb3845010.avif?t=1759817764\" width=200 height=340 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the enhance button to strengthen your weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortification requires luck, and if you're  unlucky, your weapon might break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Get Rewards!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spin the slot machine and get rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009980/extras/ac8887d1a3a5968d36cdbc156c2791cc.avif?t=1759817764\" width=462 height=671 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Test your luck!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhancement has a chance of success, and also a chance of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are ways to gain an advantage in the odds of success or destruction.</p><p cla